{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-133","published":"2026-09-02T16:39:21Z","modified":"2026-09-02T19:45:05.390177554Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-84921"],"details":"This module enables you to delete Webform submissions in bulk using a specified date range.\n\nThe module doesn't sufficiently restrict access to the delete form.\n\nA [separate PHP fatal error issue](https://www.drupal.org/project/webform_submissions_delete/issues/3396717) may prevent exploitation in practice on Drupal 10+.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/webform_submissions_delete","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/webform_submissions_delete?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.2.0"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"<1.2.0"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"<1.2.0","source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/webform_submissions_delete/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-133.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-133"}],"credits":[{"name":"Bernhard Karimi (bernhardk_oww)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/bernhardk_oww"]}]}